Association StudentDisciplineIncidentNonOffenderAssociation [3071]
    documentation "This association indicates those students who were involved and not perpetrators for a discipline incident."
    domain entity Student [3072]
        documentation "Relates the Student associated with the DisciplineIncident."
    domain entity DisciplineIncident [3073]
        documentation "Reference to the DisciplineIncident associated with the Student."
    descriptor DisciplineIncidentParticipationCode [3096]
        documentation "The role or type of participation of a student in a discipline incident."
        is optional collection
